# A studio: one room, a partition from its south wall to a free end, a door and two windows.
room studio 6000 x 4500 at 0,0 walls 200 fixed
line partition from 4000,0 to 4000,2600
on partition.start studio.south
vertical partition
door d1 900 in studio.west
window w1 1800 in studio.north centred
window w2 1200 in studio.south offset 500 from studio.sw
